### Appendix B: API Reference Summary

#### MCP Tool Definitions
**Workflow Management Tools**:
- `list_workflows` - Retrieve workflow inventory with optional filtering
- `get_workflow` - Fetch specific workflow configuration and metadata
- `create_workflow` - Define new workflow with validation and error handling
- `update_workflow` - Modify existing workflow configuration
- `delete_workflow` - Remove workflow with confirmation
- `activate_workflow` - Enable workflow for automated execution
- `deactivate_workflow` - Disable workflow execution

**Execution Management Tools**:
- `list_executions` - Monitor execution history with filtering options
- `get_execution` - Retrieve detailed execution logs and results
- `delete_execution` - Clean up execution records
- `run_webhook` - Trigger workflow execution via HTTP webhook

#### n8n API Endpoint Mapping
```
GET /workflows → list_workflows tool
GET /workflows/{id} → get_workflow tool
POST /workflows → create_workflow tool
PUT /workflows/{id} → update_workflow tool
DELETE /workflows/{id} → delete_workflow tool
POST /workflows/{id}/activate → activate_workflow tool
POST /workflows/{id}/deactivate → deactivate_workflow tool
GET /executions → list_executions tool
GET /executions/{id} → get_execution tool
POST /workflows/{id}/execute → execute_workflow (via create_workflow)
```

